{"unit_id":"Yu-tao-Li__dsh-pin#card-zh","repo":"Yu-tao-Li/dsh-pin","commit":"8589caa5c3e2137a8a80ea9c341ca312643618af","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pin（DSH 网页插件）：为侧边栏会话提供工作区内和跨工作区两种置顶方式。它在会话行加入置顶按钮，并把全局置顶会话显示在侧边栏顶部托盘。主要功能包括多会话置顶、取消后恢复原顺序、切换手动排序，以及从托盘打开会话。适合想整理较多 DSH 网页会话、快速回到常用对话的人。置顶记录保存在浏览器本地，工作区内顺序通过 DSH 提供的接口调整；不需要 API 密钥或额外外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:650-683","lib/client.js:504-557","lib/pin-core.mjs:250-303"]}
{"unit_id":"Yu-tao-Li__dsh-pin#card-en","repo":"Yu-tao-Li/dsh-pin","commit":"8589caa5c3e2137a8a80ea9c341ca312643618af","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pin is a DSH web plugin that adds workspace and global pin controls to sidebar sessions. It stacks pinned chats, restores their order when unpinned, and offers a tray for reopening global pins. Records stay in browser storage; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:650-683","lib/client.js:504-557","lib/pin-core.mjs:250-303"]}
